# Host-built virtualenvs. backend/monolith/.dockerignore already excludes
# these, but that file only applies when the build context is that directory,
# and railway.json builds from the repo root, so it never does. Left in, they
# put ~400 MB and roughly 25k Windows-built files into the upload for an image
# that installs its own Linux dependencies from requirements.txt and could not
# use them anyway.
